WEBVTT

00:12:56.375 --> 00:13:01.000
is exactly the key we need
to unlock the future that we want.

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:04.934
I have enough confidence
to believe that that world

00:13:04.958 --> 00:13:07.268
will indeed come to pass,

00:13:07.292 --> 00:13:10.559
and that we are the ones to make it so.

00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:11.893
Thank you so much.

00:13:11.917 --> 00:13:15.333
(Applause)